OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be dry with clear periods
OL,8,Falthough clouding over the across the
OL,9,Feast later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FRather cloudy with the chance
OL,12,Fof a few showers, these mainly over
OL,13,Fthe hills. Becoming generally drier
OL,14,Fthrough the afternoon and evening.
OL,15,FBest of the brightness across the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
