OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy on Wednesday and Thursday with
OL,7,Fsome showers or occasional rain,
OL,8,Fparticularly on Thursday. Cloudy again
OL,9,Fon Friday with further showers and the
OL,10,Fchance of more persistent rain
OL,11,Fpossible.
